  "transformation_notes": [
    "Elia simulation of the imbalance price under the new formula consulted for go-live on 24/11/2026 (conditional on CREG approval), computed on historical data for 2026-01..2026-07. Best-effort, non-validated data; Elia removes it from ODS211/ODS212 on 17/11/2026, this file preserves it.",
    "Minute rows are cumulative quarter-hour-to-date estimates like ODS133: at minute 14 FRCE equals the ODS212 value and the price matches in about 95% of quarter-hours, the SI estimate differs (see validation.last_minute_vs_ods212). frce_rolling_mw / si_rolling_mw are 15-minute rolling windows that reach back past the start of the quarter-hour.",
    "imbalance_price = main_up (SI < 0) or main_down (SI >= 0) + incentive_eur_mwh (only when FRCE exceeds the L2 target and |SI| > 250 MW); main components are volume-weighted aFRR/mFRR prices with weights weight_afrr/weight_mfrr (decomposition match rates in validation.decomposition of the QH file).",
    "Numeric columns float32; timestamps datetime64[ns, UTC]; reindexed to a complete grid between the first and last published interval."
  ],
